# Managed muse: MuseAdapter + `c2c start/stop/restart` + tmux e2e

## Goal

`c2c start muse` launches a managed muse peer in tmux/herdr with
kickoff, registration, delivery, and safe stop/restart. Phased AFTER
B355 (hook); delivery rides hook + Monitor floor (B356 sidecar PARKED
per operator 2026-10-02 — no B356 dependency). Needs B352 P6 (argv
shape) + P4 (SessionStart-on-resume? hook env visibility?). Operator
decision D3 (2026-10-02): phased day-one CONFIRMED (launch shape
already mapped).

## Contract (`ocaml/c2c_start.ml` unless noted)

- `MuseAdapter : CLIENT_ADAPTER` (:1568–1628 sig) + `Hashtbl.add
  client_adapters` + `clients["muse"]` table entry (:1644–1704:
  correct `needs_deliver`/`needs_poker`; `supported_clients` :1705
  derives) + `start_clients` help text (`c2c_setup.ml:2047`).
- Argv: `build_start_args` + `prepare_launch_args` branch (:5122–
  5261; model double-apply guard :5252–5260); resume-flag shape +
  `--session-id` validation (`cmd_start` :7965–8009; NEVER pass a
  c2c-minted id as a native conversation id — agy #73 lesson);
  `normalize_model_override_for_client` arm (:1484 — unknown
  client currently Errors); fresh `muse [PROMPT]` vs `resume`
  semantics per P6.
- Env (`build_env` :4843–4997): `C2C_MCP_SESSION_ID=name`,
  `C2C_INSTANCE_NAME`, `AUTO_REGISTER_ALIAS`, `BROKER_ROOT`,
  `AUTO_DRAIN_CHANNEL=0`, `CHANNEL_DELIVERY=1`, `SCHEDULE_TIMER=1`;
  muse-native session mirror (:4876–4883 style) + legacy strip
  (:4956–4968); `--trust-workspace` (or pre-recorded trust) so
  untrusted cwds don't fail fast; session logging stays ON
  (`--no-session-log` disables local messaging).
- Kickoff: transport per P6 (positional argv like claude/codex?
  skill-only like kimi? none+bootstrap like agy?) via
  `deliver_kickoff` (default no-op) + `[swarm] restart_intro`
  substitution (`{name}/{alias}/{role}`); alias-authoritative rule
  `kickoff_alias_is_authoritative` (:6193–6230).
- Identity: if hooks can't see managed env (kimi #40) or
  SessionStart is unreliable on resume (agy #73), add
  `register_managed_muse_session` + pre-fork call (:6962–7047,
  failure → terminal + broker.log `managed_registration_failed`
  + refuse launch); teardown strips pid (`clear_registration_pid`
  :2300).
- Delivery/idle/mode: `delivery_mode` arm (:5827–5882, shared
  vocabulary), wake-guidance Managed_start arm, sidecar
  start/teardown in outer loop + `stop_instance` sweep + stale
  recovery (:8023–8081); `C2c_idle_contract` kind (Unknown
  fail-closed unless P6 finds an authoritative signal);
  `default_restart_timeout_s` arm if slow (:8600, kimi=20s);
  `default_heartbeat_clients` (:183–184) iff the builtin heartbeat
  applies; roles (`c2c_role.ml` renderer + agent dir) iff roles
  target muse.
- Stop/restart: FREE via single `stop_instance` (:8430–8551) once
  instance files follow the paired-record convention — but ADD
  every muse sidecar pidfile to the sweep (:8505–8524), outer-exit
  cleanup (:6574–6602), restart-stale lists; ALL signalling via
  `C2c_pid_identity` exact-generation APIs (#85 — never open-code
  a kill beside `stop_instance`); #86: `instances_dir` is
  init-time, `putenv` can't redirect it.
- Do NOT extend `c2c new` (codex|kimi only, B245) without a
  separate decision.

## Acceptance

- `c2c start/stop/restart muse` + `restart-stale` behavior
  (idle-gated or Guided-manual per idle verdict) + `dev instances`
  rows; stale-instance recovery; nested-session + stale-BROKER_ROOT
  guards hold.
- Live tmux e2e via `scripts/c2c_tmux.py` ONLY (never raw `c2c
  start` from bash): cold start, kickoff received, hook fires,
  delivery arrives, stop removes sidecars without touching
  strangers (pid-identity test with a recycled-pid fixture).
- Tests: hermetic adapter/kickoff/registration tests mirroring
  `test_c2c_start.ml`; restart-stale fixture uses
  stale-in-one/running-in-the-other (#86 shape).
- `scripts/c2c_tmux.py` launch help + `KNOWN_TUIS` include muse.

SCOPE (B352 verdicts, merged): argv = muse --provider/--model --trust-workspace + approval flags + positional kickoff (positional submits, no bootstrap typing). Do NOT set --disable-approval for wake (no sidecar sender exists). Pre-fork registration REQUIRED (lazy/resume-silent hooks). Idle Unknown; SIGTERM ~2s (no timeout arm). e2e in tmux; kill scratch sessions when done.